  m_text: "ABALA\n[English translation Busy \nPang-uri (Adjective)\n\nKahulugan (Tagalog):
    Maraming ginagawa o pinagkakaabalahan.\LMeaning (English): Occupied with many
    tasks or responsibilities.\n\L- Halimbawa (Filipino): Abala siya sa kanyang trabaho  
    buong araw.\L- Example (English): She is busy with work all day."
